# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows autocrlf 造成整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 文本文件显式声明
*.md     text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.ps1    text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf

# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换、不做文本 diff
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.zip  binary
*.doc  binary
*.docx binary
*.ppt  binary
*.pptx binary
*.xls  binary
*.xlsx binary

# GitHub 语言统计：本仓库是 Markdown 模板，不把 md 计入"语言占比"
*.md linguist-documentation
